# Training manual note: Shelf life extension

When building the **end-of-project training manual**, include a short section on **Quality → COA Library → Extend shelf life**.

## Math (critical)
**New expiration = QC date + extension months** — **not** current expiration + months.

Example: current exp 2027-09-23, QC date 2026-09-26, months 12 → new exp **2027-09-26**.

The form prefills months from formula/FPS shelf life; user can change if re-QC grants a different term.

## Where to extend
- **Campaign lots** — Extend only on the **campaign** header (composite sample). Trickles to every member lot expiration, regenerates batch master COAs, re-issues campaign COA. Lot-level Extend is blocked for campaign members.
- **Non-campaign lots** — Extend on the individual master row.

## Soft rule
Generally only **one** extension. UI soft-warns and requires confirm for a second.

## Badge
Library shows “Shelf life extended” when an SLE exists (campaign header and/or lot rows).

After the training section is written, **delete or cancel this rule**.
